### 1. General health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Chrome CDP connection status & Gemini tab
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/cdp/status
Accept: application/json

### 3. Simple prompt (JSON response)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Explain the concept of recursion in computer science with a simple example.",
  "new_chat": false
}

### 4. Prompt starting a NEW conversation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Start a fresh chat and list 3 key features of FastAPI.",
  "new_chat": true
}

### 5. Prompt with SSE Streaming
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Write a short dialogue between a developer and a compiler.",
  "new_chat": false
}

### 6. OpenAI-compatible endpoint (Standard Chat Completion)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemini-web",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a senior software architect."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What are the core benefits of a modular architecture in Python?"
    }
  ],
  "stream": false
}

### 7. OpenAI-compatible endpoint (Streaming Mode)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gemini-web",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Write a 6-line poem about outer space and distant stars."
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}

### 8. List available models
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/models
Accept: application/json

### 9. Switch active model
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/models/select
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "pro"
}

### 10. List conversation history
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/conversations
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get account usage quotas
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/usage
Accept: application/json


